      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 14.42,
      "text": "Count the glass, count the drop Watch the needle learn to not"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.42,
      "end": 25.62,
      "text": "Rope on the rail, teeth in the gale Something patient in the fog"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.82,
      "end": 34.26,
      "text": "The raft held longer than it should Wrong nails old shirt half good wood"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.26,
      "end": 39.94,
      "text": "I left the island breathing black And felt it watching from the back"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.94,
      "end": 45.46,
      "text": "The first night kept a sailers grin A cold lip tucked beneath my chin"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.46,
      "end": 51.14,
      "text": "No stars to bard or no clean charges Plank and pulse and stubborn heart"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.14,
      "end": 58.02,
      "text": "I heard the pale roll end to end Like it had news it would not send the rope when stiff"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.02,
      "end": 62.34,
      "text": "The boards complained The weather took my shape and stayed"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.34,
      "end": 67.78,
      "text": "It doesn't arrive, it gathers weight It learns the hinges test the gate"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.86,
      "end": 74.42,
      "text": "The quiet cup, the lowered cloud The hush before the mask gets bowed"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.42,
      "end": 80.1,
      "text": "Take the reading, take it slow Pressure falling in the bones"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.1,
      "end": 88.42,
      "text": "Every breath of borrowed birth Every waiver, her spy words I keep my mouth above the swell"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.42,
      "end": 96.58,
      "text": "Hold my nerve and ring no bell If the sky is teeth and I let it find me still upright"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.78,
      "end": 112.58,
      "text": "I found the sea had lost its floor No island left to answer for"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.58,
      "end": 118.26,
      "text": "The gulls were gone The foam was hard My hands had mapped the splintered yard"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.26,
      "end": 123.78,
      "text": "I thought of cures that pulled me down A first dressed up in a cleaner gown"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.78,
      "end": 129.38,
      "text": "I thought of ships that would not turn Their windows carrying their own concern"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.38,
      "end": 134.98,
      "text": "Now nothing passed and nothing waived No almost saved, no almost brave"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.98,
      "end": 140.58,
      "text": "Just me, the boys, the weather's jaw And all the knots I never saw"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.58,
      "end": 145.14,
      "text": "It doesn't bake The common squall, it takes attendance"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.14,
      "end": 149.3,
      "text": "From us all till what we fear And what we feature"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.3,
      "end": 158.58,
      "text": "One bonk beneath the keel Take the reading, take it slow Pressure falling in the bones"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.58,
      "end": 166.9,
      "text": "Every breath of borrowed birth Every waiver, her spy words I keep my mouth above the swell"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.9,
      "end": 175.14,
      "text": "Hold my nerve and ring no bell If the sky is teeth and I let it find me still upright"
    },
    {
      "start": 175.14,
      "end": 180.66,
      "text": "I used to call the drag a shackle And call the leaving borrowed tackle"
    },
    {
      "start": 180.66,
      "end": 186.34,
      "text": "But out here names go overboard And wanting where's the sailors court"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.34,
      "end": 191.94,
      "text": "If I survive the luring glass It won't be proof the storm has passed"
    },
    {
      "start": 191.94,
      "end": 199.14,
      "text": "Just proof a crooked little craft Can keep insisting from the act"
    },
    {
      "start": 199.14,
      "end": 211.14,
      "text": "Not yet, not under Not yet, not water"
    },
    {
